── detail · the modes ──
● :mode_read: read only
    changes nothing anywhere: every write is shown and asked, and none is sent
  :mode_write: write
    may add things: comments, replies, reactions, review asks, new items
  :mode_edit: edit
    may also change what is there: approve, resolve, move, assign, rebase, merge

Local actions (check out, an editor, a terminal) and settings work in every mode.
RADAR_MODE sets it for one run: read-only, write or edit.

Now RADAR_MODE keeps radar read only for this run; the setting is kept for the next.
── status · SETTINGS ──
q quit  x extra actions  ~ notices  ←→↑↓ navigate
